+
+- `--min-qty N` only report items with quantity at least `N` (default 0).
+- `--format table` (default) prints a formatted table sorted by name.
+- `--format json` prints a JSON array of `{"name", "qty", "price"}` objects,
+  sorted by name, and nothing else on stdout.
